The Structural Pivot: Up until October 2023, Aaron Ghee was the sole director and shareholder of Seri Aman Trustees, the entity that owned the Tuhaere Street mansion. Crucially, just as their commercial development pipeline began showing severe signs of financial distress, Ghee stepped down, and Joycelyne Fei Li Ong took over as the sole shareholder and director. [1, 2]
